 ensemble process nodes with balanced/atom-conserving representations are included, hydrolysis/decarboxylation steps are spelled out, and ambiguous ensemble/oligomer processes are explicitly labeled as such in their mechanisms. All molecules and reactions are mass- and charge-conservative within each elementary reaction, except for process ensembles, as warranted by the literature. All hub intermediates (acetaldehyde, lactonitrile, lactaldehyde, aminomalononitrile, glycine) are represented as unique nodes.", "molecules": [{"id": "mol_001", "formula": "CH3CHO", "iupac_name": "ethanal", "common_name": "acetaldehyde", "inchi": "InChI=1S/C2H4O/c1-2-3/h2H,1H3", "role": "hub_intermediate", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_002", "formula": "HCN", "iupac_name": "hydrogen cyanide", "common_name": "hydrogen cyanide", "inchi": "InChI=1S/CHN/c1-2/h1H", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_003", "formula": "NH3", "iupac_name": "azane", "common_name": "ammonia", "inchi": "InChI=1S/H3N/h1H3", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_004", "formula": "CH3CH(OH)CN", "iupac_name": "2-hydroxypropanenitrile", "common_name": "lactonitrile", "inchi": "InChI=1S/C3H5NO/c1-3(5)2-4/h2-3,5H,1H3", "role": "intermediate", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_005", "formula": "H2S", "iupac_name": "sulfane", "common_name": "hydrogen sulfide", "inchi": "InChI=1S/H2S/h1H2", "role": "starting", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_006", "formula": "CH3CH(OH)CHO", "iupac_name": "2-hydroxypropanal", "common_name": "lactaldehyde", "inchi": "InChI=1S/C3H6O2/c1-3(5)2-4/h2-3,5H,1H3", "role": "hub_intermediate", "environment_formed": "Surface"}, {"id": "mol_007", "formula": "CH3CH(OH)CH(NH2)CN", "iupac_name": "2-amino-3-hydroxybutanenitrile", "common_name": "threonine aminonitrile", "inchi": "InChI=1S/C4H8N2O/c1-3(7)2-6-4(5)8/h2-4,7H,1H3", "role": "intermediate", "environment_formed": "Biochemical"}, {"id": "mol_008", "for